+## Resolved dependency review
+
+The pre-encryption baseline resolved seven non-main modules and passed the
+repository license gate. The encryption candidate adds `filippo.io/age v1.3.2`
+and its module-graph requirements, including `filippo.io/hpke v0.4.0`; the
+candidate `go.sum` is verified locally with `go mod verify`. Because the current
+isolated environment does not have every transitive module needed by
+`go mod download all`, the complete resolved-graph license scan is **BLOCKED
+locally** and remains a required exact-head CI gate. No candidate dependency is
+promoted to an approved shipped dependency merely from this table.
+
+The pre-encryption baseline's pinned `govulncheck v1.7.0` reported no reachable
+symbol or imported-package vulnerability with Go 1.25.14. The encryption
+candidate requires the same exact-head vulnerability gate after its module graph
+is resolved in CI. Any reachable advisory blocks the merge; no silent fallback
+or dependency substitution is permitted.
 
